motivation: Do the plain version today. The polished one can wait until you have something to polish.
discipline: Wash one dish. Write one sentence. The day bends toward the person who begins small.
money: Patience turns saved money into ownership; hurry turns it into regret.
mindset: A wrong turn is still a turn. I can correct the direction without shaming myself.
fact: A typical cumulus cloud weighs about as much as a hundred elephants.
books: Some things gain from disorder; stress and volatility can make them stronger.
stoic: Stop debating what a good person looks like. Spend this hour becoming one.
